<title>UK: UBS sets call warrants on Elektrowatt.</title>
<headline>UBS sets call warrants on Elektrowatt.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland says it has issued three million American-style call warrants, on Elektrowatt AG.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    525.00 SFR		PREMIUM	13.1 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     5.20 SFR		  GEARING	9.8 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 09.DEC.96-20.FEB.98   PAYDATE	09.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWX			 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  510.00 SFR</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
